{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>喬迪在HackerOne上使用「2tonejordy」這一名稱。他在自己的X賬號上談及這筆獎金，還開玩笑説，錢至少夠買《GTA6/俠盜獵車6》。</p>\n<p>索尼通過HackerOne開展漏洞獎勵計劃。研究人員私下提交安全問題，索尼隨後有時間調查和修復；獎金金額與漏洞嚴重程度相關。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"索尼向PlayStation嚴重漏洞報告者支付5萬美元 具體漏洞尚未公開\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261016/1792114986_759280_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>喬迪曾在2026年9月因報告PlayStation 5虛擬機監控程序漏洞受到關注。當時，另一名研究人員正在研究主機的Linux支持，兩人圍繞報告時機發生分歧。目前沒有證據表明，這次5萬美元獎金對應的就是9月那項漏洞。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"索尼向PlayStation嚴重漏洞報告者支付5萬美元 具體漏洞尚未公開\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261016/1792114983_674851_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"索尼向PlayStation嚴重漏洞報告者支付5萬美元 具體漏洞尚未公開\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261016/1792114986_759280_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T08:39:55.031477+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":244,"images":3,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T08:22:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T17:58:13.386384+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T08:37:39.146668+00:00","content_hash":"c429fc0bd78e886782f2ab3b3bb873a31fd0f09da9cccdb06d8d64f22ad327c4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}